<PageTitle>About | CineTrack</PageTitle><h1>For the love of film</h1><p>CineTrack helps you discover movies, organize your watchlist, and remember what you have watched.</p><p>Movies, genres, posters, cast and trailers are loaded from TMDB. Search online or revisit your saved movies. Ratings use a five-star scale.</p><p>Your collection is stored in this browser. Clearing browser storage removes it.</p><p>Online data and images are provided by <a href="https://www.themoviedb.org/">TMDB</a>. This product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB.</p>
